<i>♪ I'm all right ♪</i>

578
00:53:36.963 --> 00:53:39.090
<i>♪ Tell my white lies ♪</i>

579
00:53:39.591 --> 00:53:41.635
<i>♪ Till the day comes ♪</i>

580
00:53:42.135 --> 00:53:44.054
<i>♪ Let it all go ♪</i>

581
00:53:44.596 --> 00:53:46.889
<i>♪ In the high tide ♪</i>

582
00:53:46.890 --> 00:53:51.352
<i>♪ Even if I crash to the shore ♪</i>

583
